                        "glosses": [
                            "Similar to the character Simon Tappertit in Dickens' Barnaby Rudge, especially being self-important, passionately conservative and anti-Catholic, and given to big ideas poorly expressed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
