                                "sense_id": "69db5b3a-39c2-3aab-9ffe-fc979dee5379",
                                "text": "I have been proof against the garish splendors and alcoholic excitements of the ordinary stage combinations of Tappertitian romance with the police intelligence."
                            },
                            {
